<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="footer-description">
            <h3>About This Tool</h3>
            <p>
                Discover the ultimate online text utility with this Text Case
                Converter. Designed for simplicity and speed, this tool is
                completely free, contains no ads, and does not track your
                activity. Instantly transform your text to the exact style you
                need for your projects, posts, or programming tasks.
            </p>
            <p>
                Please note that you'll get more controls via the settings. But
                always keep in mind that settings stay as they are until you
                reset the site data, which may cause issues when you return
                later and find that some features are not working as expected,
                even due to a space added in special characters.
            </p>
            <p>
                Whether you're a developer needing to switch between <strong
                    >camelCase</strong
                >, <strong>PascalCase</strong>, and <strong>snake_case</strong>,
                a writer perfecting your headlines with <strong
                    >Title Case</strong
                > and <strong>Sentence case</strong> options, or a student organising
                data, this tool provides instant, accurate results without any hassle.
                Enjoy a clean, fast, and private text conversion experience.
            </p>
            <p>
                This project was built with the help of LLMs. As a designer, I
                often had to rely on external tools for text conversion — a
                tedious process. Creating this tool was my way of simplifying
                that experience once I had the right opportunities and
                resources.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-features">
            <h3>Supported Conversions</h3>
            <ul class="case-list">
                <li>Sentence case</li>
                <li>lower case</li>
                <li>UPPERCASE</li>
                <li>Title Case</li>
                <li>Absolute Title Case</li>
                <li>camelCase</li>
                <li>PascalCase</li>
                <li>snake_case</li>
                <li>kebab-case</li>
                <li>dot.case</li>
                <li>ALTERNATING case</li>
                <li>AlTeRnAtInG cAsE</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
